# Copy to .env for local development. .env is untracked; never commit a key.
#
# PrimeUI Community License key for PrimeNG 22. Without it the app shows a red
# "Invalid PrimeUI License" banner in the browser. See
# docs/decisions/0001-primeui-licence-posture.md.
#
# The team key is held as the Paperclip company secret PRIMEUI_LICENSE_KEY. Ask
# the owner for the value; do not paste it into a tracked file.
PRIMEUI_LICENSE_KEY=
